# This repository holds Markdown and YAML, nothing that compiles, so there
# is no build output to ignore. What is left is the clutter your operating
# system and editor leave behind.
#
# Compare this with the .gitignore you will write for your C++ and ROS 2
# assignments. A .gitignore should match the project it sits in, not be
# pasted from a template.

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Linux
*~
